questions.explanation:
Why This Is Asked: Tests ability to design progressive delivery with multi-region, no manual hacks. Key Concepts: Cloud Deploy pipelines, region-scoped traffic controls, Cloud Run traffic splits, Cloud Monitoring alerting, automatic rollback, minimal IAM. Code Example:```javascript
const deployConfig = {
  pipeline: 'region-canary',
  stages: [
    { region: 'us-east1', canary: 0.05, durationMin: 20 },
    { region: 'global', canary: 0.20, durationMin: 30, guard: 'latency<0.85' }
  ],
  rollback: 'setTraffic(v3)';
};
```
